<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>International prices for milling and Durum wheat were lower as lack of significant export business and weak world demand pressured prices, the Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said. Wheat indicator prices for multi-grade contracts 96/97 fell by A$5.00 while Durum fell by A$3.00.</p>
<p>Prices, FOB, in A$ per tonne:</p>
